---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="Privacy notice (draft)" description="Draft privacy notice for the 3Dads demonstration release." noindex>
  <div class="container prose" style="padding:56px 0 96px">
    <p class="badge badge-warning">Draft · demonstration content, not a published policy</p>
    <h1 class="h2" style="margin-top:12px">Privacy notice (draft)</h1>
    <p>This draft describes how the demonstration release handles data. It is not legal advice and has not been reviewed by counsel.</p>
    <h2>What the demonstration stores</h2>
    <p>Project data, uploaded reference images, scene edits, run history and simulated billing records are stored in your browser (IndexedDB and local storage). They are not transmitted to 3Dads or any third party in this release.</p>
    <h2>What we do not collect</h2>
    <p>No analytics, tracking pixels, third-party scripts or account credentials are used. Demo accounts have no passwords.</p>
    <h2>Deleting data</h2>
    <p>Use the account menu → Demo scenarios → “Reset all demo data”, or clear site data in your browser.</p>
    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>hello@3dads.example</p>
  </div>
</Base>
